          "This article exists because those claims are still in circulation — in sermon illustrations, in church video nights, in the confident memory of people who saw a documentary twenty years ago. A reader who first meets the correction here has probably heard the claims from someone they trust and have no reason to doubt. That is worth saying, because the point of this article is not to make anyone feel foolish.",
